  <item>
    <title>第92期：我的日常工作，是在南极探险</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7846bd000a55a9bb0527d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7846bd000a55a9bb0527d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 09:29:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位水手们：</span></p><p><span>周末好，你最期待的播客之一，海盗电波，终于更新了。威尔船长目前正带领一群少年，在呼伦贝尔草原腹地进行无机械动力远征，这里天苍野茫、信号微弱。今天，趁着参加两位蒙古族朋友的草原婚礼，终于蹭到了一点难得的网络。</span></p><p><span>本期节目录制于6月，彼时威尔的好友Rose，一位从事“极地探险队员”（Expedition Guide）的女士，刚刚结束北极的船上工作正在休假，于是两人远程连线，录制了一期节目。曾经是都市白领丽人的她，为何脱离人生的轨道，成为一名极地探险向导，选择去南极探险、在北极漂泊，与鲸鱼、海豹、企鹅、北极熊等动物打交道？真实的极地探险队员日常工作是怎样的？会收获哪些惊险刺激的难忘人生体验？</span></p><p><span>听过这期对话，这份神秘职业的种种，就如海中冰山，对你渐露真容。</span></p><p><span>本期音乐：《Full Sail》Ryan Farish</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvCn6hmTebiP28-CULzpRuO2j7Ya.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FldJNW-P_QmVnMnqNxubakVw1rOi.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo_7DEL5Vc62NM74pIrdnnaO2irk.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq32-R1XzqJRENXDtDtGQdE5mVQJ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhyLUu3bZukcEsze11YdII_y5KlP.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuEycNyp_PdtB7iJyDHj5EKzgt9T.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjbaEOvrjwOLU5wW4cdNOwadaAAx.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsprUG0b--kzSAg7ruEIYsgJWCXS.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkci1mpVfHhMV2NSmXNfGb8vpP-j.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FujIgYVKxFbtt_ZSy7Zz34Usfm5j.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvduuzJF2MU2HcVlup9dnh0V5QqQ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvXmNx1CQqTBgGZfiJiNCKphxR1H.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2Lwxmq5GQUvRGwt-s3td5GYzvD.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9FFyqkoIz6G_evLXMJhgUmSBGF.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg_nt-CKvULNjGl0RuQqbKtBy5by.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlBl0T8lxjmiCFr-sqHLiGNxO7DA.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2CSluf81NUsHduYQpf6m60WEMc.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkzzZQniK6rynewZzTgxZRmUI2JQ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnL_lzA0grHOEnd4audGQJKg1-fC.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq162B5Ne0YpL2-qY3AndnqzO-qC.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
